 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 532558,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You decide to install a new front door with a semicircle top as shown in the figure. How much area will the new door occupy?<br>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/03737e038be63c21.png\" alt=\"A door resembles a semicircle placed on top of a rectangle. The length and width of the rectangle are 6.25 feet and 3.5 feet. The diameter of the semicircle is 3.5 feet.\">\n</figure>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The door is a rectangle plus a semicircle.</p>\n<p>The rectangular area is:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A = LW = \\left( {{\\text{3}}{\\text{.5 ft}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\text{6}}{\\text{.25 ft}}} \\right) = 21.875{\\text{ f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>The area of a circle with radius <i>r</i> is <span data-math=\"A = \\pi {r^2}\"></span>, but you want half of that.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{2}A = \\frac{1}{2}\\pi {r^2} = \\frac{1}{2}\\pi {\\left( {\\frac{{3.5}}{2}{\\text{ ft}}} \\right)^2} \\approx 4.8105{\\text{ f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>Add the two results: <span data-math=\"{\\text{(21}}{\\text{.875  +  4}}{\\text{.8105)}}\"></span> square feet</p>\n<p>The total area is approximately 26.7 square feet.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"A = 21.875 + 4.8 = 26.7\\,{\\text{f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}\">A = 21.875 + 4.8 = 26.7\\,{\\text{f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
